sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / DSP API
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as workflow-controller<br/>9090/TCP metrics<br/>6060/TCP health
    participant Pod as Workflow Step Pod
    participant ArgoExec as argoexec<br/>(sidecar in Pod)
    participant Artifacts as Artifact Store<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant SQL as SQL Database<br/>3306/5432/TCP

    Note over User,SQL: Flow 1: Workflow Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: new Workflow<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Pod for step<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Pod: Pod scheduled & started

    Note over ArgoExec: argoexec injected as<br/>wait/sidecar container

    ArgoExec->>Artifacts: Download input artifacts<br/>Auth: Storage credentials
    Artifacts-->>ArgoExec: Artifact data

    Note over Pod: Main container executes<br/>workflow step logic

    ArgoExec->>Artifacts: Upload output artifacts<br/>Auth: Storage credentials
    Artifacts-->>ArgoExec: Upload confirmation

    ArgoExec->>K8sAPI: Create WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: task result<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over User,SQL: Flow 2: Workflow Archive (optional)

    Controller->>SQL: Archive completed Workflow<br/>Auth: Username/Password
    SQL-->>Controller: Archive confirmation

    Note over User,SQL: Argo Server API Access (optional)

    participant Server as argo-server<br/>2746/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    User->>Server: REST/gRPC API request<br/>Auth: SSO/Bearer Token
    Server->>K8sAPI: Query Workflows<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Server: Workflow data
    Server->>SQL: Query archived workflows<br/>Auth: Username/Password
    SQL-->>Server: Archived data
    Server-->>User: API response
